&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;In
the absence of sufficient and satisfactory cycle parking provision, the
development has failed to provide sufficient secure, integrated, convenient and
accessible cycle parking facilities and thus fail to promote sustainable form
of transport, contrary to Policy T16.2 of Merton’s Local Plan 2024 and T5 of
the London Plan 2021.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;By
reason of the lack of an energy statement (demonstrating that the scheme would
achieve a 100% improvement on Part L, Building regulations 2021), a lack of
information to demonstrate water usage rates and a lack of information relating
to ventilation or overheating, the applicant has failed to demonstrate that the
proposal would meet the requirement of Local Plan 2024 Policies CC2.1, CC2.2,
CC2.3, CC2.4 CC2.5and CC2.6.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;In
the absence of a satisfactory Air Quality Neutral Statement, the applicant has
failed to demonstrate that the development would be at minimum air quality
neutral, not worsening local air quality thereby and failing to comply with
policy SI1 of the London Plan 2021&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;In
the absence of convenient, satisfactory and adequate refuse and recycling storage facilities and collection arrangement for the
development, the applicant has not demonstrated that the scheme would safeguard the free flow of traffic in the locality, visual
amenity of the area and amenity of nearby occupants in terms of noise and disturbance. The scheme is contrary to, in particular, Policies D4, SI 7 &amp;amp; SI 8 of
the London Plan 2021, Merton Local Plan 2024 policy D12.2, D12.3 and W14.4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table class=&quot;MsoNormalTable&quot; border=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; style=&quot;width: 100%; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none;&quot;&gt;
 &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;
  &lt;td width=&quot;572&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;width:429.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:
  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm&quot;&gt;
  &lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;
  font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The scheme provided no parking survey to
  demonstrate there is capacity in the locality to accommodate the parking
  shortfall and that the scheme would not adversely impact on parking, the free
  flow of traffic and pedestrian and vehicular safety on the surrounding roads.
  The scheme fails to comply with Policy T6 of the London Plan and Policy T16.1
  of Merton&#x27;s Local Plan 2024.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;table class=&quot;MsoNormalTable&quot; border=&quot;1&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; style=&quot;width: 100%; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none;&quot;&gt;
 &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;
  &lt;td width=&quot;572&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;width:429.25pt;border-top:none;border-left:
  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm&quot;&gt;
  &lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;
  font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;By reason of absence of As Designed internal
  water calculations and specifications for any proposed water fittings to
  demonstrate the development will achieve internal water usage of less than
  105 litres per person per day, the applicant has failed to demonstrate that
  the application would meet the requirement of Merton Local Plan 2024 policy
  CC2.6.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
